Codex App DeepSeek Gateway

This repository contains an independent integration for the official Codex App.
The integration code is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

It depends on pure protocol modules from codex-deepseek-runtime at
cb788738864e97a16cde82f3c584164162ab6f7c (published 0.6.7, Apache-2.0).

The native patches modify OpenAI Codex source at
680c4ba93ec79c292287fb9e0b627dc7a76e3b5e (Apache-2.0).
Upstream LICENSE and NOTICE are retained in licenses/.
Modified source identities and patch provenance are recorded in native/.

The proprietary desktop App package is obtained separately from its official
publisher; it is not included in this source repository or Python package.
Additional binary dependencies require their corresponding license notices
in any assembled native distribution.

The build-time native notice collector follows the CDS collector; it does not
load CDS runtime code. Canonical SPDX license texts retain the source commit,
URLs and checksums recorded in native/license-data.json. Native distributions
retain each external crate's declared license and original available notices.
